---
title: Email Task — Happy Path Lifecycle
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as SaaS Platform API
    participant HTTP as HTTP Producer API
    participant Redis as Redis Streams
    participant Worker as Worker Goroutine
    participant Idem as Idempotency Store
    participant Email as Email Provider

    Client->>HTTP: POST /v1/tasks<br/>(X-API-Key, X-Tenant-ID, JSON body)
    activate HTTP

    HTTP->>HTTP: Validate API key + tenant
    HTTP->>HTTP: Validate request body (Recipient, Type, TemplateID)
    HTTP->>HTTP: Build EmailTask{ID=UUIDv4, TraceID=from OTel ctx}

    HTTP->>Redis: XADD queue:email:{priority} * {id, payload, tenant_id, trace_id}
    Redis-->>HTTP: stream message ID

    HTTP-->>Client: 202 Accepted {task_id, status: "pending"}
    deactivate HTTP

    Note over Redis,Worker: (Asynchronous — different pod, different time)

    Worker->>Redis: XREADGROUP GROUP email-workers worker-1<br/>COUNT 10 BLOCK 5000 STREAMS queue:email:high >
    Redis-->>Worker: [{id: "1234-0", fields: {payload: "..."}}]
    activate Worker

    Worker->>Idem: EVALSHA idempotency_cas.lua<br/>KEYS[idempotency:{taskID}] ARGV[workerID, ttl, now]
    Idem-->>Worker: 1 (acquired)

    Note over Worker: Start OTel span "worker.process"<br/>continuing from task.TraceID

    Worker->>Email: POST /v3/mail/send {to, template_id, dynamic_template_data}
    activate Email
    Email-->>Worker: 202 Accepted
    deactivate Email

    Worker->>Redis: XACK queue:email:high email-workers 1234-0
    Redis-->>Worker: OK

    Worker->>Idem: SET idempotency:{taskID} {status:"completed"} EX 86400
    Idem-->>Worker: OK

    Worker->>Worker: metrics.RecordProcessed(success, duration)<br/>log task.completed<br/>span.End()
    deactivate Worker
